lockout-unseen-codex.webp","alt","Office-stealth gameplay with the player behind desks, a coworker, a minimap and 149 seconds remaining.","https://www.bilibili.com/toy/clockout-unseen/index.html","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","GameMap browser capture","list","attribution","Creator-attributed clients / models (not inferred from related tools)","items",[80],"Codex","links","Related resources",[86],"resourceIds","section",{"_57":87,"_25":88},"OpenAI Codex","/resources/codex/","Creator evidence",[92],"evidence",{"_57":93,"_25":94,"_95":96},"Read the explicit Codex and human contribution account","https://github.com/Ryan-fm/clockout-unseen/blob/main/docs/DEVELOPMENT.md","note","Creator record names GPT-6 Astra in Codex, gives selected requests and distinguishes independently generated artwork from coding-model work.","Source contents","complete project","Project source",[101],{"_57":102,"_25":103,"_95":104},"Open the complete game project","https://github.com/Ryan-fm/clockout-unseen","Complete React/Canvas source, maps, original office/character PNGs, tests and Vite configuration. Run npm ci then npm run dev. No runtime AI key. README labels current source V2; verify hosted-version differences before comparing features.","Access type","playable","demo","Play or run",[110],{"_57":111,"_25":68,"_95":112},"Play Clock Out Unseen","Chinese interface on Bilibili Toy. Wait for scene assets, then start a level. WASD/arrows move, E interacts and Space uses a folder disguise; mobile joystick/buttons are supplied. The game opened and started without sign-in.","Game platform","Browser","Guide format","build log","tutorial","Build story / tutorial",[120],{"_57":121,"_25":94,"_95":-7},"Read the creator’s development record","Study this workflow","ordered",true,[126,127,128,129],"Start Normal mode and move behind office furniture.","Read the selected prompts and model contribution record.","Trace movement, line-of-sight and disguise rules in the engine.","Change one patrol rule and check immediate detection, retry and level progression.","AI workflow / foundation context","Ryan-fm supplied the office-stealth concept and approved the visual direction. GPT-6 Astra in Codex iterated on collisions, sightlines, patrols, interactions, progression, mobile controls and tests. A separate image-generation tool created office and character art.","aiUse","guidance","Creation category","AI-assisted (creator attribution)","category","provenance","Track","2D","track","metadata","Engine","Canvas 2D · React UI","engine","lead","2d","ai-assisted",[126,127,128,129],{"_57":121,"_25":94,"_17":157},{"_57":111,"_25":68,"_17":106,"_95":112},{"_57":102,"_25":103,"_155":156,"_95":104},{"_57":93,"_25":94,"_95":96},[154],"codex","scope","complete-project","build-log",{"_159":160},"documents",{"_161":162,"_163":164},"en",[166,170,171,172,169,173,174,175,176,177,178,179,180,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,168,205,167,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226],"zh",[165,166,167,168,169],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","media